  "description": "Proposed internal alterations and roof modification to an existing two-bedroom flat. The property is currently arranged with two bedrooms and one bathroom at first floor level, and a living room with an ancillary loft space used for storage at second floor level. The proposal seeks to retain the existing layout at first floor level. At second floor level, the existing pitched roof will be raised and altered to form a flat roof in order to increase internal head height and improve the usability of the space. The existing loft area will be refurbished and converted into an additional bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe, and a new bathroom will be installed directly above the existing first floor bathroom to simplify service connections. There is no change of use proposed, and the property will remain in residential use as a single dwelling.",
